      "caption": "Misconception: mutations are always harmful",
      "duration_ms": 9000,
      "id": "s5",
      "narration": "Mutation sounds like damage — and some mutations are, when a broken protein causes disease. But most mutations change nothing at all, and a rare few are beneficial: they are the raw material of evolution.",
